  "contrast_note": "WCAG 2.x AA: 4.5:1 normal text, 3:1 large text and graphics [CHECK against the current WCAG text]. Pseudo-roles: \"dark\" = the darker of ink and bg, \"light\" = the lighter. Every palette is dark. ink on bg is held to 7:1 because the vignette and grain eat contrast at the edges. shadow is the silhouette tone and must separate from bg by at least 2:1 or figures vanish; highlight is the light itself.",
